      "html": "<h1>Lesson 1: True Authority Effect</h1><h2>Signaling authority</h2><ol style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li>1. Master stillness<ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li>◦ Don't fidget or make nervous movements.</li><li>◦ Hold stillness before speaking to allow others to anticipate your words.</li></ul></li><li>2. Confident tone<ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li>◦ Speak slightly slower.</li><li>◦ Avoid rising intonation at the end of sentences.</li><li>◦ Use pauses strategically.</li></ul></li><li>3. Unshakable mindset<ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li>◦ Avoid second-guessing yourself.</li><li>◦ Make decisions with certainty even if you don't have it.</li><li>◦ Stop over-explaining.</li><li>◦ Maintain eye contact when stating your opinion.</li></ul></li></ol><p>People mirror your confidence back.</p><p><a href=\"#\">riseguide/confidencecode</a></p><p><a href=\"#\">books</a></p>",
